## Claim: Essential-sup tail condition is necessary for sublinear regret
Status: refuted
Confidence: high
Dependencies: Refutation uses process-wise/law-aware interpretation.
Evidence: If \(P_t\stackrel{iid}{\sim}\mathrm{Unif}[0,1]\), then for any \(a<1\),
\[
