./iterations/iter_008/solution_critic_01.md:10:   The attempt says the same iff holds “for infinite classes with a product-closed/no-gap condition,” but it does not define the attainable reward set \(C\), the product topology closure, the policy class, or the exact no-gap assumption at horizon \(T\) and grid \(G_T\). The notes show this is a real issue, not bookkeeping.
